{"about_the_game":"You probably have fought giants in other games and it was a challenging task but... How about playing as one?<br>In Giants Uprising you take control of big and very angry guy and noone should stand in your way.<br><strong>YOU are the embodiment of revenge and havoc!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/8aae84a7607103f1f94be2fed1cbe96c.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/8aae84a7607103f1f94be2fed1cbe96c.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/8aae84a7607103f1f94be2fed1cbe96c.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Destruction:</strong> crush everything standing in your way. If you see something - most likely you can flatten it! Feel the unrelenting force and sheer dominance!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/4ad7c559ce010bf99d2d2105df29c8c6.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/4ad7c559ce010bf99d2d2105df29c8c6.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/4ad7c559ce010bf99d2d2105df29c8c6.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Epic battles:</strong> fight hundreds of infantry and their siege equipment or pick someone your size and clash with other bloodthirsty giants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/f9b4f9fa2e3e13ad609dca3d31cc62b0.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/f9b4f9fa2e3e13ad609dca3d31cc62b0.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/f9b4f9fa2e3e13ad609dca3d31cc62b0.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Impactful abilities:</strong> pick your destiny and passive abilities to guide you in your journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/24b837cd03d23b56ac8f7f2c2ae04552.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/24b837cd03d23b56ac8f7f2c2ae04552.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/24b837cd03d23b56ac8f7f2c2ae04552.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Customization:</strong> cause mayhem with style! Customize your giant and soak your new clothes in blood.<br><br><br><br><strong>STORY BEHIND THE CARNAGE</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/44704ceaa9dacef73be4cde2b90ee2d9.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/44704ceaa9dacef73be4cde2b90ee2d9.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/44704ceaa9dacef73be4cde2b90ee2d9.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The ancient race of giants dwindles. Their wisdom is all but forgotten, powerful kings of old dead, and their once proud, great cities lie in ruin, slowly consumed by time and elements. Betrayed by humans - their former friends and allies - nowadays enslaved giants serve as workers and terrible machines of war, used by humans to expand their vast domains.<br><br>But the time of reckoning is nigh. As a runaway giant slave, accompanied by your fellow human convict, you will carry your wrath, anger and lust for revenge to the oppressor's settlements. Reclaim your right to freedom, find what happened with your enslaved kin, smash your enemies and be the spark of the Giant's Uprising!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/daa416e1206d55bc840ed6275ffa88e0.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/daa416e1206d55bc840ed6275ffa88e0.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/daa416e1206d55bc840ed6275ffa88e0.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The giant\u2019s blood pumping through your veins boils and demands a sacrifice now. Feel the real power coming from the deep-seated origins of domination and violence.<br><br>Since the human race enslaved your kin, you only know to hate, shed blood. But there is only one way to quench your thirst for righteousness - to kill everyone on your way, destroy village after village, and depose leaders whose wealth got paid in giant\u2019s freedom.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/1142de6792eef88653544f3d960ac202.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/1142de6792eef88653544f3d960ac202.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/1142de6792eef88653544f3d960ac202.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Humiliation and slavery are the crude everyday realities of being a Giant. But do not abandon your brothers, and do not forget that through this darkness you and your human companion will carry the light of freedom.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1109160/709a53f95fa6c821ddf480d4f3f73d6073ab64c2.jpg"},{"name":"First steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1109160/7c26aaefba219ce1605c79ae6fb02b988159d3cd.jpg"},{"name":"That wasn't even an actual enemy, dummy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1109160/fba2be9a266c832e0842f76c916dc84cee0652f7.jpg"},{"name":"Giant's tactics 101","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1109160/215585d095885feae1c593f05bfb9ca9756a89ae.jpg"},{"name":"Hear the crowd's roar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1109160/b86d6bedf44ca31b7b4014c6ba09434034fd561d.jpg"},{"name":"Who's unstoppable now, huh?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1109160/4aa659a528618af9e04beb11ecef3a86fab8d8e5.jpg"},{"name":"Probably not the crowd's favourite giant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1109160/d4ac0a927c382a7454eca0c2815a0740e7d6b020.jpg"},{"name":"Rogbar the Unstoppable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1109160/8e23d553ccec90755d6afbf589a0a1ac943dbb70.jpg"},{"name":"The great escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1109160/4094f00d1cd64b2550803a7bd4f8e4ccbb13c403.jpg"},{"name":"Wreck-it Rogbar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1109160/e5263eb393f7c16ebe6da249bb0608a0a78ad17a.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1109160?t=1757674712","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757674712","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757674712","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757674712","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violence and blood being a part of combat. Swear words appear in dialogues from time to time."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"You probably have fought giants in other games and it was a challenging task but... How about playing as one?<br>In Giants Uprising you take control of big and very angry guy and noone should stand in your way.<br><strong>YOU are the embodiment of revenge and havoc!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/8aae84a7607103f1f94be2fed1cbe96c.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/8aae84a7607103f1f94be2fed1cbe96c.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/8aae84a7607103f1f94be2fed1cbe96c.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Destruction:</strong> crush everything standing in your way. If you see something - most likely you can flatten it! Feel the unrelenting force and sheer dominance!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/4ad7c559ce010bf99d2d2105df29c8c6.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/4ad7c559ce010bf99d2d2105df29c8c6.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/4ad7c559ce010bf99d2d2105df29c8c6.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Epic battles:</strong> fight hundreds of infantry and their siege equipment or pick someone your size and clash with other bloodthirsty giants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/f9b4f9fa2e3e13ad609dca3d31cc62b0.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/f9b4f9fa2e3e13ad609dca3d31cc62b0.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/f9b4f9fa2e3e13ad609dca3d31cc62b0.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Impactful abilities:</strong> pick your destiny and passive abilities to guide you in your journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/24b837cd03d23b56ac8f7f2c2ae04552.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/24b837cd03d23b56ac8f7f2c2ae04552.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/24b837cd03d23b56ac8f7f2c2ae04552.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Customization:</strong> cause mayhem with style! Customize your giant and soak your new clothes in blood.<br><br><br><br><strong>STORY BEHIND THE CARNAGE</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/44704ceaa9dacef73be4cde2b90ee2d9.poster.avif?t=1757674712\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/44704ceaa9dacef73be4cde2b90ee2d9.webm?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1109160/extras/44704ceaa9dacef73be4cde2b90ee2d9.mp4?t=1757674712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The ancient race of giants dwindles. Their wisdom is all but forgotten, powerful kings of old dead, and their once proud, great cities lie in ruin, slowly consumed by time and elements. Betrayed by humans - their former friends and allies - nowadays enslaved giants serve as workers and terrible machines of war, used by humans to expand their vast domains.<br><br>But the time of reckoning is nigh. As a runaway giant slave, accompanied by your fellow human convict, you will carry your wrath, anger and lust for revenge to the oppressor's settlements. Reclaim your right to freedom, find what happened with your enslaved kin, smash your enemies and be the spark of the Giant's Uprising!<br><br><br><sp